rotein  Progestin receptor  Negative  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  07 REMOVED_MONTH 93 at 13 29 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab  labeled  Left breast   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 9cm piece of fibroadipose tissue with a localizing wire in place and an attached specimen x ray  The specimen is inked and sectioned  revealing a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 6cm tan  firm  gritty  ill defined mass that grossly abuts the inked resection margin  The remainder of the specimen is composed of fibroadipose tissue with fibrous white bands  A representative piece is frozen as Frozen Sections  1 and  2 and saved frozen  Representative tissue is taken for estrogen receptors and BRDU studies  The remainder of the specimen is submitted in A through N  Resident  Cynthia E  Flynn  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1 2  LEFT BREAST   INFILTRATING DUCTAL CARCINOMA  SCIRRHOUS TYPE  O R  Resident  Essam Ahmed  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Robert Henry Young  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SURGICAL DAY CARE   ACC 3 REPORTS TO  Charles Mason Ferguson  M D  PART   LEFT BREAST   report_end  , Yes.
